    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispering Fog is a first person psychological horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mysterious ever-changing forest of suffocating fog, a quiet getaway becomes a sinister nightmare as the illusion of safety and solitude slowly crumbles around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game builds tension over time to create a dreadful and terrifying experience, dripping with atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/f3e991390adb25c63c404c1384093db2.poster.avif?t=1754188395\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/f3e991390adb25c63c404c1384093db2.webm?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/f3e991390adb25c63c404c1384093db2.mp4?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment and Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to stay a week in an inherited cabin in the mountainous forest, far away from the loudness of the city. What should have been a relaxing getaway quickly begins to go horribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether by supernatural forces, cryptid interference, or deteriorating sanity, this once peaceful forest grows more unsettling each night. Venture out to complete your nightly tasks throughout these woods, if you dare to step outside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/0655bd64368e755376b7d80bcf0017a8.poster.avif?t=1754188395\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/0655bd64368e755376b7d80bcf0017a8.webm?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/0655bd64368e755376b7d80bcf0017a8.mp4?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Lurks in the Woods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't alone. Something stalks you from just out of sight and slowly creeps closer, biding its time and growing bolder throughout the nights. It will make its presence known and break down any semblance of security you think you might have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/7be86e55ab8cb37bc1b23c0cf0da2f3a.avif?t=1754188395\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispering Fog is a first person psychological horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mysterious ever-changing forest of suffocating fog, a quiet getaway becomes a sinister nightmare as the illusion of safety and solitude slowly crumbles around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game builds tension over time to create a dreadful and terrifying experience, dripping with atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/f3e991390adb25c63c404c1384093db2.poster.avif?t=1754188395\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/f3e991390adb25c63c404c1384093db2.webm?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/f3e991390adb25c63c404c1384093db2.mp4?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment and Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to stay a week in an inherited cabin in the mountainous forest, far away from the loudness of the city. What should have been a relaxing getaway quickly begins to go horribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether by supernatural forces, cryptid interference, or deteriorating sanity, this once peaceful forest grows more unsettling each night. Venture out to complete your nightly tasks throughout these woods, if you dare to step outside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/0655bd64368e755376b7d80bcf0017a8.poster.avif?t=1754188395\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/0655bd64368e755376b7d80bcf0017a8.webm?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/0655bd64368e755376b7d80bcf0017a8.mp4?t=1754188395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Lurks in the Woods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't alone. Something stalks you from just out of sight and slowly creeps closer, biding its time and growing bolder throughout the nights. It will make its presence known and break down any semblance of security you think you might have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/7be86e55ab8cb37bc1b23c0cf0da2f3a.avif?t=1754188395\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
